  ```
  The result from the code is \( 4.666666666666666 \), which is equivalent to the fraction \( \frac{14}{3} \).
  
  So, the value of \( f(-2) + f(-1) + f(0) \) is \(\boxed{\frac{14}{3}}\).
  
